    "text_column_with_image_qwLJPR": {
      "type": "text-column-with-image",
      "blocks": {
        "column_yUtdNE": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/img_-_2024-09-10T101039.335.png",
            "image_link": "",
            "open_new_window_image": false,
            "sub_title": "",
            "title": "Instant Check",
            "highlight_type": "underline",
            "heading_size": 100,
            "text": "<p>This is a quick way to learn and test yourself. Read a word / commonly-used phrase / sentence from a dialog text and think about the translation. You will also hear the word / phrase / sentence in French. Click on 'Show answer', then click on whether you knew the correct answer or not. This saves time because you don't have to type in the answer. You can switch back and forth between testing yourself in English or in French.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_new_window": false,
            "show_button_style": "primary"
          }
        },
        "column_ribCFT": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/img_-_2024-09-10T101043.431.png",
            "image_link": "",
            "open_new_window_image": false,
            "sub_title": "",
            "title": "Multiple Choice",
            "highlight_type": "underline",
            "heading_size": 100,
            "text": "<p>Read a word in either French or English and think about the translation. Listen to the word in French. You will then be presented with your choice of between three and fifteen possible translations (you can choose how many possible translations appear). You then have fun choosing the one correct translation.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_new_window": false,
            "show_button_style": "primary"
          }
        },
        "column_inicNx": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/img_-_2024-09-18T093443.026.png",
            "image_link": "",
            "open_new_window_image": false,
            "sub_title": "",
            "title": "Entering Text",
            "highlight_type": "underline",
            "heading_size": 100,
            "text": "<p>This is a very thorough method. You can type in the translation of words or commonly-used phrases. If your spelling is correct, simply move on. If not, type in the correct spelling as shown. This learning method ensures that you have spelled every word and phrase in the course correctly.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_new_window": false,
            "show_button_style": "primary"
          }
        },
        "column_zRUXFe": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/img_-_2024-09-18T093253.732.png",
            "image_link": "",
            "open_new_window_image": false,
            "sub_title": "",
            "title": "Read and Listen",
            "highlight_type": "underline",
            "heading_size": 100,
            "text": "<p>Read through a list of French words, commonly-used phrases or sentences from the dialog texts. With a simple click you can also hear all of the words / phrases / sentences in French, as often as you wish. Listening is a relaxing yet very effective learning method. You automatically associate what you hear with what you read. The entire contents of a lesson will be presented, which provides a convenient overview of the particular lesson.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_new_window": false,
            "show_button_style": "primary"
          }
        },
        "column_g8Tahg": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/img_-_2024-09-18T093258.372.png",
            "image_link": "",
            "open_new_window_image": false,
            "sub_title": "",
            "title": "Quick-Show",
            "highlight_type": "underline",
            "heading_size": 100,
            "text": "<p>Read the words or sentences as they appear on your screen, listen to them in French and then repeat what you have just heard. This is a copying game. Pretend you’re an actor and you have to imitate the native speakers. Whatever they say, you have to say. You will quickly develop accurate French pronunciation and intonation. You can decide how much time elapses before the next word or sentence appears.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_new_window": false,
            "show_button_style": "primary"
          }
        },
        "column_ErAAML": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/img_-_2024-09-18T093302.238.png",
            "image_link": "",
            "open_new_window_image": false,
            "sub_title": "",
            "title": "Learn Individual Words",
            "highlight_type": "underline",
            "heading_size": 100,
            "text": "<p>Read an individual word in either English or French. You will also see a picture that depicts the meaning of the word. Think about the translation, then with a simple click the correct translation appears. Your progress is greatly supported by a familiar context. Based on your existing knowledge, a clear connection between the sight of the picture and the sound of the French word is created.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_new_window": false,
            "show_button_style": "primary"
          }
        },
        "column_YM9WwN": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/img_-_2024-09-18T093305.739.png",
            "image_link": "",
            "open_new_window_image": false,
            "sub_title": "",
            "title": "Hidden Text",
            "highlight_type": "underline",
            "heading_size": 100,
            "text": "<p>A list of covered words or sentences will be presented to you, in your choice of either English or French. You simply uncover the correct translation by 'hovering' over the covered section with your cursor. This is the fastest way to test your knowledge of French words and sentences.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_new_window": false,
            "show_button_style": "primary"
          }
        },
        "column_PKQGn3": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/img_-_2024-09-18T093309.312.png",
            "image_link": "",
            "open_new_window_image": false,
            "sub_title": "",
            "title": "Dictation",
            "highlight_type": "underline",
            "heading_size": 100,
            "text": "<p>Individual words or sentences will be read to you in French. You then type in what you have just heard, without reference to the text or the English translation. This exercise is recommended for those who are nearing the end of a course and would like to practice their French spelling or sentence structure.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_new_window": false,
            "show_button_style": "primary"
          }
        },
        "column_7BNNb3": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/img_-_2024-09-18T093313.389.png",
            "image_link": "",
            "open_new_window_image": false,
            "sub_title": "",
            "title": "Flash Cards",
            "highlight_type": "underline",
            "heading_size": 100,
            "text": "<p>You can make your own flash cards by printing words and sentences onto paper. This is a great way to learn when you don't have Internet access. All you need is a standard printer with standard paper and a pair of scissors. You can print out the current lesson, or all lessons.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_new_window": false,
            "show_button_style": "primary"
          }
        },
        "column_9p9Nk8": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/img_-_2024-09-18T093316.899.png",
            "image_link": "",
            "open_new_window_image": false,
            "sub_title": "",
            "title": "Digital Dictionary with Search Function",
            "highlight_type": "underline",
            "heading_size": 100,
            "text": "<p>Type a word into the 'Search function' and it will instantly be translated. You can view all of the references to the word in the course at the same time so that you learn how the word is used in various contexts. With a simple click you can also hear all of the references in French.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_new_window": false,
            "show_button_style": "primary"
          }
        },
        "column_7qMih4": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/img_-_2024-09-18T093320.455.png",
            "image_link": "",
            "open_new_window_image": false,
            "sub_title": "",
            "title": "Complete the Word",
            "highlight_type": "underline",
            "heading_size": 100,
            "text": "<p>Only the first part of a word will be visible and you have to complete the word. This learning method is very helpful when focusing on French words where the last part of the word changes to give a slightly different meaning.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_new_window": false,
            "show_button_style": "primary"
          }
        },
        "column_LCQDNq": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/img_-_2024-09-18T093324.824.png",
            "image_link": "",
            "open_new_window_image": false,
            "sub_title": "",
            "title": "Jumbled Words",
            "highlight_type": "underline",
            "heading_size": 100,
            "text": "<p>The words of a sentence will be randomly scrambled. You then put the words back together in the correct order by considering the translation. This learning method improves your French grammar, comprehension and sentence construction.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_new_window": false,
            "show_button_style": "primary"
          }
        },
        "column_dUFKzK": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/img_-_2024-09-18T093330.515.png",
            "image_link": "",
            "open_new_window_image": false,
            "sub_title": "",
            "title": "Missing Word - Cloze Test",
            "highlight_type": "underline",
            "heading_size": 100,
            "text": "<p>Read a sentence in French with a word missing. Think about the correct way to fill in the gap. You then fill in the gap by clicking on the designated symbol or pressing 'Enter'. This learning method improves your French grammar, comprehension and sentence construction.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_new_window": false,
            "show_button_style": "primary"
          }
        }
      },
