    "rich_text_gRAqnb": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_9b7rwR": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "P.S. Would you like a recap of why this is a Great deal?",
            "highlight_type": "underline",
            "heading_size": 100,
            "heading_tag": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_by3thf": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>No other company in the world</strong> offers lifetime access to an equivalent set of French language courses for our low price! Our multimedia courses are superior to, or as effective as, the language courses offered by the largest companies in the world; yet their price is up to five times higher than our price. Furthermore your French vocabulary will be twice as extensive with our courses because we provide you with twice as many words, which equates to even more value-for-money. Our competitors provide up to 3000 words and phrases. We provide over 7000 words and phrases, ranked according to importance. We provide the most comprehensive courses on the market.<br/></p><p>These online courses can be accessed by any device at <strong>any time from anywhere.</strong> You will learn precisely what you want to learn precisely when you want to learn it and will do so at your personal optimal learning pace. Each session will be seamlessly integrated into your schedule for effortless learning on your terms.<br/></p><p>Once you have purchased these five courses you <strong>own them for life</strong>. You may pass your courses on to your family and friends, as the courses can be reset to new. Our competitors won't let you do this, but we're here to support you. You, as well as your family and friends, can also retake the courses as many times as desired at any time in the future and it won't ever cost another cent. All future upgrades and improvements are free.<br/></p><p>The courses will certainly make <strong>beneficial gifts</strong> one day. You will make some fortunate people very happy with the gift of a foreign language education. Let's say you become fluent in French within the next few months and then, years from now, you decide to retake your courses at a slow pace just for fun. Many years after that you decide to pass your courses on to friends as beneficial gifts. Let's say during all of those years your courses were actively used for three years. $97 divided by three years is $2,70 a month. Would you regard $2,70 a month for a rewarding skill as great value-for-money?<br/></p><p>The ability to speak another language is a skill that you will <strong>continuously benefit from for life</strong>, therefore the price structure of language courses should also be viewed in the long-term. For example, after ten years of unlimited access your courses cost $0,80 a month. The one-off fee of $97 divided by ten years is $0,80 a month, which is certainly great value-for-money.<br/></p><p>You had the <strong>complete personal flexibility</strong> to take / retake / pass on your courses whenever it was convenient for all of those years, as well as the benefits that are continuously derived from speaking French fluently. Spread out over a lifetime, the price becomes insignificantly low. That is the advantage of a one-off fee: the price is locked in and cannot increase, but the value-for-money increases every month for life.<br/></p><p>We want to make this decision as easy as possible for you. This <strong>exceptional 60% discount</strong> is the biggest in our company's history. $97 is the lowest price we have ever offered to individual customers for these five French language courses. This current special offer will end! We reserve the right to remove this special offer at any time, without warning. Why spend more later, when it's too late to save $150?<br/></p><p>Simply order now and you won't ever spend another cent. <strong>This is handled for life</strong>. Furthermore, all credit / debit card and PayPal fees are currently included in our low price. We have partnered with the world's most popular and secure payment companies, PayPal and Stripe.<br/></p><p>These courses are completely <strong>tax-free</strong> for you, regardless of which country you live in. If there is any tax, we will pay it. Most of our customers live outside of the European Union and therefore are not subject to local sales tax, known as VAT in Europe. In order to comply with this law we are required to ask for your country of primary residence.<br/></p><p><strong>We are a reputable, trustworthy and ethical company</strong> that is bound by all applicable EU laws. Your email address will not be shared with any third party. All necessary precautions have been put in place to ensure that your email address is completely protected.<br/></p><p>Learning French is enjoyable and rewarding! Studies have reported an <strong>increase in cognitive ability and self-confidence</strong> in those that can speak more than one language. Both foreigners and locals have more respect for a person that can speak a foreign language because the ability is immediately perceived as a sign of superior intelligence.<br/></p><p>As the world becomes 'smaller' with each passing month those that can only speak one language will continue to be at a disadvantage, regardless of which country they are from and which language they speak. This disadvantage could be in the form of opportunities missed or fun experiences denied. <strong>Learning French has never been this affordable and this easy</strong>, so there simply is no reason why you should miss out.<br/></p><p>A wonderful sense of achievement is derived from the ability to speak another language. You have more options, more freedom, more fun and <strong>get more out of life</strong>. Whether you learn French for new friendships, the love of your life, personal development, culture immersion, career advancement, adventure travel or as an enjoyable hobby, you will benefit tremendously.<br/></p><p><strong>Fluency is at your fingertips</strong>. Don't miss this opportunity to become fluent in French at a 60% discount. We take you from absolute beginner to absolute mastery. Our unique learning methods are <strong>empirically proven to accelerate progress</strong> with minimal effort, so that learning French is both easy and fun.<br/></p><p>All of the benefits that are continuously derived from speaking French fluently are yours forever. You will make a great impression on everyone you meet for a very reasonable one-off fee. $97 is an economical price for a rewarding skill you will have for life. Simply order now and these <strong>bestselling courses are all yours at the lowest price ever</strong>. Do you agree that it makes sense to lock in the lowest price? We provide a 100%-money-back guarantee, so you have no risk and nothing to lose but a lot to gain. Join our one million satisfied customers and speak French with ease and confidence right now.</p>",
            "number_of_lines_shown": "none",
            "read_more_label": "Read more"
          }
        },
